#: cups/kmwbanners.cpp:101
msgid ""
"<p>Select the default banners associated with this printer. These banners "
"will be inserted before and/or after each print job sent to the printer. If "
"you don't want to use banners, select <b>No Banner</b>.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>Tchoezixhoz les prémetowès banires po cisse sicrirece ci.  Ces banires "
"la seront stitcheyes divant eyet/ou après tos les eprimaedjes so li "
"scrirece. Si vos n' voloz nole banire, tchoezixhoz <b>Pont d' banire</b>.</p>"

